<title>SINGAPORE: Want Want first half net up 35.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Want Want first half net up 35.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			28.94	vs     21.41</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	   7.73	vs	5.71</p>
<p>    Turnover			 121.71	vs     91.40</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax	     30.88	vs     21.80</p>
<p>    Tax				  1.88	vs	0.39</p>
<p>    Other income		     3.10	vs	1.28</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 3.01	vs	2.56</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation    5.59	vs	2.73</p>
<p>    Minorities			 0.06	vs	nil</p>
<p>Note - Want Want Holdings Ltd is a snack manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
